    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>I'm Mohamad.</p>
    <p>I live in Malaysia. I run mybusinesswork.com.</p>
    <p>You're busy. Amazon pages are long. I read them so you can choose faster.</p>
    <p>I look at the listing. I look at the specs. I read verified buyer reviews.</p>
    <p>Then I write the short version. Who it is for. Who should skip it. What to watch.</p>
    <p>I haven't used these products myself. This is not a hands-on test, unless a post says so.</p>
    <p>I don't invent prices. I don't invent test numbers. I don't say "I tried it."</p>
    <p>
        Some links go to Amazon. If you buy through one, I may earn a fee. You don't pay extra.
        As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.
    </p>
    <p>The longer note is on the <a href="/disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a> page.</p>
